<p>Told Randomini I was going to defend this to the death, and might as well start now.</p>
<p><em>Note: MASSIVE SPOILERS BELOW</em></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Please&nbsp;do&nbsp;not&nbsp;murder,&nbsp;Kalinin-senpai</a></div>
